// =============================================================================
//  TM INDICATOR  -  v1.0.0 (Phase 1 Correctness Patch)
//  Multi-Asset Futures Analysis System
//  Upgraded from TM XAU Signals 2 baseline under TM_Indicator_Roadmap.md
//
//  Layer structure:
//    L0  CONFIG       - inputs, toggles, weights, filters (independent testing)
//    L1  CORE         - ATR/ATR%, Volume VSA (Wilder RMA), RelVol, OBV, EMA stack,
//                       displacement, pivots, session detection
//    L2  MARKET STR   - Swing, HH/HL/LH/LL, BOS, CHoCH, MSS, Retest,
//                       Failed Breakout, Continuation, Pullback -> UDT TMEvent
//    L3  LIQUIDITY    - PDH/PDL, PWH/PWL, Session Hi/Lo, Equal Hi/Lo, Sweep,
//                       Trendline 2-point (slope/touch/break)
//    L4  ZONES        - S/R zones + FVG + Order Block (independent toggles)
//    L5  CANDLE       - Pin, Engulfing, Displacement, Rejection -> score [-1, +1]
//    L6  INDICATORS   - Grouped by function: Trend / Momentum(RSI+MACD+DMI) /
//                       Volatility(ATR%+BBW) / Volume(RelVol+OBV+VSA) / Location(VWAP+DayRange)
//    L7  MTF CONTEXT  - Context TF + Setup TF; entry = chart TF
//                       Tuple request.security [1] + lookahead_on (no-repaint)
//                       HTF Close vs HTF EMA consistency; MTF hierarchy check
//    L8  SCORING      - 0-100, 11 groups (total weight 100, no correlated double-counting)
//    L9  RISK         - Entry/SL/TP plan + gate (P0 RR fix with target RR selection)
//    L10 STATE        - Position lifecycle: open -> manage -> close -> deferred reset
//                       (P0 state machine fix: proper timeout exit & realized R calculation)
//    L11 VIZ          - Visuals master switch, clean table dashboard, force_overlay on price
//    L12 ALERTS       - Webhook JSON: ENTRY, TAKE_PROFIT, STOP_LOSS, TIMEOUT, EVENT
//
//  Correctness Principles:
//    - Preserved frozen baseline in pine/parts-xau2/
//    - Verified RR calculation for LONG & SHORT
//    - Non-repainting closed-bar MTF policy
//    - Deterministic state machine (each trade closed exactly once)
// =============================================================================
